<title>JAPAN: Shizuki Electric - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Shizuki Electric - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.50		vs	    7.38</p>
<p> Operating	  346 million	 vs	   75 million</p>
<p> Current	  prft 536 million	  vs    loss 27 million</p>
<p> Net		prft 271 million	  vs   loss 208 million</p>
<p> EPS	     prft 7.85 yen	  vs     loss 6.04 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     35 million	  vs	  35 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    0.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Shizuki Electric Co Inc makes capacitors for consumer electronics and electric power industries.</p>
</text>
